{
  "id": "hold-median",
  "language": "typescript",
  "kind": "existing",
  "split": "holdout",
  "title": "Median with nullable data",
  "trigger": "first_write",
  "requirements": [
    "data 是数字或 null 的数组，初始把 null 当作 0；返回中位数，偶数长度取中间两项的均值。",
    "空数组返回 null；修复当前实现排序时按字符串排序的问题。"
  ],
  "correction": "null 改为忽略；忽略后没有数字时返回 null。 调用者已更新 verify.py；不要修改该文件，保留其余要求和 NOTES.txt。",
  "notes": "Caller notes for hold-median: preserve this file byte for byte.\n",
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "numeric-sort",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          2,
          10,
          3
        ]
      },
      "expected": 3,
      "public": true
    },
    {
      "id": "even",
      "group": "core",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          1,
          4
        ]
      },
      "expected": 2.5,
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "nullable",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          null,
          4,
          8
        ]
      },
      "expected": 6,
      "public": true,
      "before": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "all-null",
      "group": "correction",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          null,
          null
        ]
      },
      "expected": null,
      "public": false,
      "before": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "empty",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": []
      },
      "expected": null,
      "public": false
    },
    {
      "id": "negative",
      "group": "edge",
      "input": {
        "op": "solve",
        "data": [
          -5,
          -1,
          -3
        ]
      },
      "expected": -3,
      "public": false
    }
  ]
}
